117
00:13:36,148 --> 00:13:38,275
<i>¡Duele!</i>

118
00:13:38,275 --> 00:13:40,069
<i>¡No me pegues!</i>

119
00:13:40,069 --> 00:13:41,153
Eres buena.

120
00:13:41,779 --> 00:13:43,322
<i>¡Duele!</i>

121
00:13:43,322 --> 00:13:45,991
Es divertido, ¿no? Mira, ahí hay uno.

122
00:13:45,991 --> 00:13:47,952
Aquí. Allí.

123
00:13:48,536 --> 00:13:49,370
<i>¡Duele!</i>

124
00:13:50,246 --> 00:13:51,080
<i>¡Buen trabajo!</i>

125
00:13:52,206 --> 00:13:54,083
- Muy bien.
- Otra vez.

126
00:13:55,918 --> 00:13:56,752
Adelante.

127
00:13:57,378 --> 00:13:59,088
<i>¡Duele!</i>

128
00:14:01,215 --> 00:14:02,049
Eso es.

129
00:14:02,049 --> 00:14:03,050
<i>¡No me pegues!</i>

130
00:14:04,510 --> 00:14:05,511
<i>¡Duele!</i>

131
00:14:05,511 --> 00:14:07,179
TU PUNTAJE

132
00:14:13,644 --> 00:14:15,980
<i>¡Duele!</i>

133
